      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Run **`python3 monitoring/density/run.py run both`**. Fixed order rate, descending memory limits, no application CPU limits, warmup at every limit and repeated measurements. **Projected slots are not proven concurrent capacity.** An allocation passes only when all repeats meet latency/reliability gates with sampled node CPU headroom. Missing CPU telemetry or runtime interruptions are inconclusive. RAM pool excludes infrastructure and host overhead. Java uses equal per-service allocations; Wasm shares its host allocation. Stop other tests, keep the machine awake, and consult **report.html** for the smallest passing tested allocation and any inconclusive outcomes."
